+EOF
+  else
+    cat <<'EOF'
+# Implementation Notes
+
+## Decisions Made
+- Created a mock implementation artifact.
+
+## Spec Deviations
+- None
+
+## Testing
+- Mock script execution only
+EOF
+  fi
